# Do not rebuild the mobile APK unprompted

Never run `flutter build apk` (release or debug) unless the user explicitly asks to rebuild or install an APK in that message.

Flutter/Dart code changes are allowed. Leave the APK as-is after those edits. Do not treat “Flutter work happened” as permission to build.
